      "subject": "fix(runtime): locks live in runtime-data; the dev data reset works and is development-only",
      "body": "Runtime project locks followed process.cwd(), so starting Runtime from apps/lumina-runtime left an untracked runtime-locks folder in the working tree; they are operational state and now live under the gitignored runtime-data root like other operational data. Settings > Security called resetAllData without importing it, so Reset & re-seed would throw; it is now imported and, like the role switcher, shown only in development builds, since it wipes the demo data in the browser.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
